reolink_incompatible.description:
A Home Assistant update changed its Reolink integration, and this version of Reolink Viewer cannot work with it.

Until Reolink Viewer is updated, its panel still shows your devices and their settings, but live view, recordings and events are off. Your cameras keep recording, and the Reolink app still works.

Update Reolink Viewer in HACS when a new version is out. If none is out yet, report this at the project's issue tracker with these details: {errors}
